# NEXARA Command Center

A dark-themed operational dashboard inspired by modern command-center interfaces for asset monitoring, fleet tracking, telemetry, and alert management.

## Features
- Live asset dashboard
- Real-time alert summary
- Movement and route tracking visualization
- Telemetry metrics panel
- System health monitoring
- Mission and weather overview
- Responsive dashboard layout

## Tech Stack
- Node.js
- Express
- HTML
- CSS
- Vanilla JavaScript

## Run locally

```bash
npm install
npm start
```

Then open:

```bash
http://localhost:3000
```

## Folder Structure

```bash
nexara-command-center/
├── public/
│   ├── index.html
│   ├── styles.css
│   └── app.js
├── server.js
├── package.json
├── README.md
└── .gitignore
```

## Notes
This project is built with realistic mock data to visually match a command-center dashboard and can be extended with real GPS, telemetry, authentication, and database integration.
